    <p class="note" id="mirN">MIRROR: the SiM draws exactly what the Controller is sending (PARs, strobe, laser, fog) instead of running its own show. Busk on the CC. Works when the SiM is opened from the Controller (its /sim page) &middot; at work run the Controller in DESK mode with a Desk Pi listening to the PC.</p>
