// (QUIET) or jumps to >=3x the build's red (WALL). How long the quiet ran is remembered across reads (screen clock), so:
//   quiet >= 4 bars ......... BIG: the build-up roll + the breath (1 beat dark) + the hit           (djbRun + liveBoom)
